# Files/folders in this list are excluded from the Vercel deploy bundle.
# They still live in the repo so the team can read them; Vercel just
# never builds or serves them.

# Round 43 — design reference (Claude Design export, React source of truth for
# the look of the "Come funziona" guides). We port the visuals to vanilla JS
# in host-guides.js; the raw .jsx files never ship.
design-ref/

# Round-planning docs, human-only artefacts.
PLAN_rounds_33_35.md
RELEASE.md
SPEC_*.md

# Migrations run against Supabase directly (via MCP or the SQL editor).
# The deployed bundle doesn't need them, and shipping them makes it
# easier for someone to guess at internals.
migration_*.sql
seed_*.sql
